==Rules==
{{StageRule|12thAnni}}

==Battleground==
*2 [[Sir Seal]]s spawn after 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>, delay 20~26.67 seconds<sup>600f~800f</sup>.
*30 [[B.B.Bunny|B.B.Bunnies]] spawn after 3.33 seconds<sup>100f</sup>, delay 13.33~20 seconds<sup>400f~600f</sup>.
*1 [[Shy Boy]] spawns after 33.33 seconds<sup>1,000f</sup>.
*1 [[St. Pigge the 2nd]] spawns after 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>.

==Strategy==
Anti-red Units like [[Fish Cat (Normal Cat)|Island Cat]] and [[Ancient Egg: N101 (Rare Cat)|Courier Cat]] works pretty well here alongside some Meatshields.

